{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","title":"KeyTable","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeyTable"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorModel"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeyTable","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:9IvorModel8KeyTableV"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyTable","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/UsingIvorModel"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each entry’s "},{"code":"Key","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is in effect from its beat time until the next entry. Before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first entry nothing is said about the key, which is distinct from an atonal key and from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"key with no sharps or flats. The first entry needn’t be at time 0.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A key is descriptive: it never decides how a note is spelled, shown or played, and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"nothing checks that notes fit it. It’s work-wide and at concert pitch, and, like the meter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"table, it lives on the work, not on a part, and only in beat time. Entries may fall at any beat","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"time, with nothing tying them to the meter table’s barlines, and an entry may repeat the key","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Its one invariant holds after every mutating method, and decoding rejects a table that breaks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it: there’s at most one entry per beat time.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormodel\/keytable"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/Entry"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/init()"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/hasExtras"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/augment(by:anchor:)","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/diminish(by:anchor:)","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/insert(beatTime:key:extras:)","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/invert(around:)-2ueg7","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/invert(around:)-8ciix","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/key(at:)","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/move(by:)","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/move(entryID:to:)","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/remove(entryID:)","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/removeAll()","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/reverse(within:)","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/transpose(by:)-6rp07","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/transpose(by:)-7oqgr","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/transpose(by:)-84cm1","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable\/update(entryID:key:extras:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generate